">Sonogashira</add_text><add_text color="#223238" x="987.0799999999997" y="758.0" size="9" handle="new:163">trans-R¹Pd(II)X(L2)</add_text><add_text color="#223238" x="1126.1999999999998" y="758.0" size="9" handle="new:164">入：R²C≡CCu；离：CuX</add_text><add_text color="#223238" x="1306.36" y="758.0" size="9" handle="new:165">胺碱脱端炔 H；炔保持 180° 线型</add_text><draw_shape color="#C7D9DA" shape="line" x="897.7999999999997" y="762.0" x2="1528.9599999999998" y2="762.0" handle="new:166" /><page width="1697.8000" height="968.0000" across="1" down="1" /><add_text color="#124C59" x="0" y="900" size="11" handle="new:167">共性说明：四个循环共用 Pd(0)(PPh3)2 ⇌ Pd(II) 平台（16e⁻/18e⁻），L = PPh3，X = I/Br/OTf；① Heck 无转金属，靠烯烃配位与 β-H 消除成键；② 碱先与 Pd 交换生成 Pd–OH 再转金属；③ 有机锌自身足够亲核，不需外加碱；④ Cu 辅循环负责把端炔变成可转金属的铜炔化物。</add_text></actions><plugin name="绘图增强" version="" ok="true" tools="21" /></result>